# The grey box's looks (feedback, 2026-11-02): looking up from the floor (the sky and the horizon),
# then up the stairs onto the platform, and looking down while turning (the floor at the sides).
# Film it with tests\e2e\run_e2e.ps1 -Steps greybox_look.steps (built with BOOT_ON_FOOT 1)
wait_up # booted on foot in the corridor (BOOT_ON_FOOT): no ride there
shot gl_00_stood
# Y: look up, from the floor
keydown y
wait 0.6
shot gl_01_look_up
keyup y
wait 0.5
# Turning at floor level: the sides, mid-turn
keydown right
wait 0.2
shot gl_01b_turning
keyup right
keydown left
wait 0.2
keyup left
wait 0.3
# Up the stairs onto the platform (13 s holding Up: short of its lip)
hold up 13
wait 0.3
shot gl_02_platform
# B: look down, and turn right while looking down
keydown b
wait 0.6
shot gl_03_look_down
keydown right
wait 0.15
shot gl_04_turning_down
wait 0.15
shot gl_05_turning_down
keyup right
wait 0.3
shot gl_06_turned_down
keydown left
wait 0.3
shot gl_07_turning_back
keyup left
keyup b
wait 0.5
# Y: look up from the platform
keydown y
wait 0.6
shot gl_08_look_up_high
keyup y
